loop A A2 B B2 A A2 A+3 A2+3

# Boss section: the helicopter. The bass chops into rotor sixteenths, the hook turns B Phrygian (C natural) over
# Bm / C, orchestra hits land in base; in Y the hook climbs to the top of the lead. The sting is B major.
